window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Finding new horizons in hostile lands.</b></p> <p>Jia and Eui, as the representatives of the tentative new alliance between Yamato and Goryeo, must travel to the hostile Qin Empire to make their case for a unified front against the otherworldly invaders—and maybe save their best friend from an arranged marriage in the process. But getting there is going to be a bigger challenge than they ever expected. Along the way, they'll meet new friends and old enemies and learn to challenge their assumptions about other people—and themselves.</p> <p>Join Yoshika and friends as they continue their progression fantasy adventure about friendship, love, self-discovery, personal growth, and, of course, magical martial arts!</p>"; 
